The calibrated Spectra 6 preview palette and browser-side e-paper processing
approach were informed by epdoptimize, licensed under Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/paperlesspaper/epdoptimize

Four interface icons are derived from Lucide, licensed under the ISC License:
https://lucide.dev/

The local iPhone preview frame and status-bar geometry are based on Apple
Design Resources and the Mockify device-layering reference. The Mockify React
package is distributed under the MIT License:
https://github.com/Mecury-Labs/mockify

The local status-bar overlay follows the iOS 26.2 iPhone 17 Pro Simulator
reference on Apple's 402 x 62 point status-bar coordinate system. It is a
small local transparent PNG so the fixed 9:41 time, cellular, Wi-Fi and
battery indicators stay aligned at every CSS size; a CSS-only fallback is used
only if that local asset fails to load. The interactive Dynamic Island remains
a separate local interface layer. The overlay is a visual reference, not an
Apple system asset.

